    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reactions based game needing quick decisions whether to buy or sell a made up chart as it is moved up and down in value.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hold down the left mouse button to charge the shot. When you shoot it the amount charged will be loaded into the bullet. This is the amount you will buy when you hit the chart ticker's buy button with your bullet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different chart tickers are more volatile so move more rapidly up or down which also affects the price and how much you earn from what is put in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to time it right to buy or sell. As if the chart goes too far to the right of screen, the top or bottom of the screen it is gameover. Once you hit the sell button with your bullet you cash in any virtual gains/losses you have made with that chart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highscores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game saves your high score at gameover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Mouse Button</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Reactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reactions based game needing quick decisions whether to buy or sell a made up chart as it is moved up and down in value.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How it works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hold down the left mouse button to charge the shot. When you shoot it the amount charged will be loaded into the bullet. This is the amount you will buy when you hit the chart ticker's buy button with your bullet. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different chart tickers are more volatile so move more rapidly up or down which also affects the price and how much you earn from what is put in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to time it right to buy or sell. As if the chart goes too far to the right of screen, the top or bottom of the screen it is gameover. Once you hit the sell button with your bullet you cash in any virtual gains/losses you have made with that chart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highscores</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game saves your high score at gameover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Mouse Button</p>",
    "short_description": "Reactions based virtual trade game. Buy and sell made up charts by shooting the buy and sell buttons. You need to time it right when to buy and sell as you see the price go up or down, don't let the chart go off the screen. Watch your numbers go up or down as you make quick decisions.",
